  "details": "Using your own stickers and photographs as Reskins/textures for accessories and items\n\nThe idea came to me when looking at the new trampoline and I was like wouldn't it be funny if I could reskin it using a photograph with my friends face  on it.\n\nthis idea may also be very useful for any accessories clothing \n\nso imagine buying a backpack and you can add your own texture for it or even your favorite memes.\n\nthis should give a bit more value to the whole store if you can add your own skins to an object\n\nsomething to think about thanks for reading.",
